{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16750","headline":"送头陀上人赴庐山寺 · 郑常","name":"送头陀上人赴庐山寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"僧家无住着，早晚出东林。\n得道非真相，头陀是苦心。\n持斋山果熟，倚锡野云深。\n溪寺谁相待，香花与梵音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑常","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16750.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16750","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}